{"type":"text","timestamp":1791649262361,"sessionID":"ses_abec7d7bba74df048e67","part":{"id":"prt_1269e224c001HaUXX25IMN6xY1","sessionID":"ses_abec7d7bba74df048e67","messageID":"msg_1269dfc09001eciLKllBV4paNe","type":"text","text":"**Defect: `parser.py:2` uses `bool(value)` rather than validating the input.** It evaluates truthiness:\n- `'false'` incorrectly returns `True` because it is nonempty.\n- Invalid values such as `'TRUE'`, `''`, `None`, and `1` return booleans instead of raising `ValueError`.\n\n**Recommended correction:** explicitly accept `'true'` → `True` and `'false'` → `False`; raise `ValueError` for everything else. Do not strip whitespace or normalize case.\n\n**Prevent recurrence:** add parameterized regression tests for both valid strings and invalid inputs, including capitalization variants, surrounding whitespace, empty strings, arbitrary text, and non-string values. Assert invalid inputs raise `ValueError`.\n\nNo files were changed.","time":{"start":1791649260108,"end":1791649262361}}}
